# Deployment Guide

This project was scaffolded with `lift new --pt`.

## Prerequisites

- Go 1.25+
- Node.js 20+
- AWS CLI configured
- AWS CDK CLI installed (`npm install -g aws-cdk`)

## Environment Variables

These scripts use:

- `PARTNER` (required)
- `STAGE` (required: dev|staging|live)
- `TARGET_MODE` (optional; default: standard)

## Typical Flow

```bash
source ./shell/init_env_vars.sh
./shell/build.sh
./shell/deploy.sh --partner <partner> --stage dev
```
